# No production signing key is shipped.
# Generate one on the catalog server. The private key stays there, mode 600:
#   vital-market keygen --private /etc/vital/market.key --public /etc/vital/marketplace.pub
# Copy the public file over this placeholder (same bytes) and rebuild the
# ISO so clients trust https://vital-os.org/api/v1/catalog. Until a real
# public key is here, the Marketplace app uses the bundled unsigned sample
# and refuses unsigned remote catalogs. Do not commit the private key.
